      "title": "Wild Oregon Mushrooms and Creamy Polenta with red Oaxacan mole",
      "handle": "wild-oregon-mushrooms-and-creamy-polenta-with-red-oaxacan-mole",
      "body_html": "<p>One of our classic Luxefly meal bags, featuring a generous mix of wild Oregon mushrooms -such as chanterelles, morels, and black trumpet-alongside select cultivated varieties like oyster mushrooms. Prepared with creamy organic polenta and finished with a rich red mole recipe handed down for generations and prepared by Carmela, one of our Luxefly chefs. </p>\n<p>Naturally gluten free.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div data-itsgot-user=\"1369\" data-itsgot-external-variant-id=\"49832965800233\" data-itsgot-label=\"11982\"></div>\n<script async=\"async\" src=\"//itsgot.com/embed.js\"></script>",
