      "id": 9485240795433,
      "title": "Black and Blueberry Shortbread Cobbler",
      "handle": "black-and-blueberry-shortbread-cobbler",
      "body_html": "<p>A sweet treat that travels beautifully. </p>\n<p>This delicious cobbler features organic blackberries and blueberries picked from a farm next to chef Sara's home and dried at peak seasonal ripeness. Finished with fresh baked shortbread, an oat crumble and a gently sweet creme anglaise, it's rich, comforting, and not overly sweet. </p>\n<p>Try snacking straight from the bag! </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div data-itsgot-user=\"1369\" data-itsgot-label=\"11673\"></div>\n<script async=\"async\" src=\"//itsgot.com/embed.js\"></script>",
