    {
      "id": 9332550893865,
      "title": "Filet Mignon Beef Stroganoff",
      "handle": "filet-mignon-beef-stroganoff",
      "body_html": "<p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\"><br></p>\n<p>Discover the pinnacle of comfort cuisine with our filet mignon stroganoff, where succulent beef tenderloin meets a velvety cream sauce infused with shiitake and cremini mushrooms. Each ingredient has been thoughtfully selected to deliver layers of flavor—the umami richness of shiitake paired with the subtle earthiness of cremini creates an exceptionally refined sauce. This is stroganoff reimagined for the discerning palate, offering timeless elegance in every spoonful.</p>\n<p> </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div data-itsgot-user=\"1369\" data-itsgot-label=\"11672\"></div>\n<script async=\"async\" src=\"//itsgot.com/embed.js\"></script>",
